Wiring notes

· The invocation prompt intentionally mirrors Aegis preflight fields 1:1, so a pasted one-liner satisfies preflight without back-and-forth.
· The SECURITY.md internal commitments restate the same controls Aegis checks, so a review can quote SECURITY.md as the intended baseline and report drift as a finding (e.g., "declared in SECURITY.md §CI/CD; not enforced — see F-06").
· Add the advisory source + cadence to SECURITY.md and to the invocation prompt; domain 5 requires a named source and check date to be VERIFIED.

